# Keep the Layer-1 build context free of weights, datasets and scratch.
# Weights live in the runtime cache (AIM_CACHE_PATH) and are never baked in.
# The harness reads evaluation references from /workspace/data (or AIM_DATA_DIR)
# when the user mounts them there.

**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.ckpt
**/*.bin
**/*.safetensors
**/*.onnx
**/*.gguf
**/*.h5
**/*.npz
**/*.pkl
**/*.cif
**/*.pdb
**/*.a3m
**/*.tar
**/*.zip
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/._*
**/.DS_Store
